---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Corbin Riches holds a BASc in Engineering Physics from Queen's University and is pursuing his MASc there, researching dark-photon detection.">
	<section class="page-header">
		<p class="eyebrow">about</p>
		<h1>Making abstract physics measurable.</h1>
		<p>I hold a BASc in Engineering Physics from Queen's University and am currently pursuing my MASc there. My interests lie in problems that bring together theory, computation, and experimental hardware.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section two-column about-columns">
		<div>
			<h2>Research</h2>
			<p>My MASc research is part of the CATCHY experiment, exploring quantum-enhanced approaches to dark-matter detection. My work brings together optical excitation, quantum sensing, and cryogenic experimental hardware. My research is supervised by Dr. James Fraser and Dr. Joe Bramante.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="terminal-card" aria-label="Research areas">
			<p><span>&gt;</span> photonics &amp; coherent optics</p>
			<p><span>&gt;</span> dark matter &amp; quantum sensing</p>
			<p><span>&gt;</span> cryogenic parahydrogen systems</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section two-column about-columns">
		<div>
			<h2>Background</h2>
			<p>I grew up in a small town in Northwestern Ontario and came to Queen's to study Engineering Physics. What increasingly drew me toward experimental physics was the possibility of making very abstract ideas measurable — moving from fundamental physics, through experiments and instrumentation, toward techniques and devices that can do something useful.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="terminal-card credential-card" aria-label="Education">
			<dl class="credentials">
				<div class="credential-row">
					<dt>MASc</dt>
					<dd class="credential-program">Engineering Physics</dd>
					<dd class="credential-university">Queen's University</dd>
					<dd class="credential-meta">Expected 2028</dd>
				</div>
				<div class="credential-row">
					<dt>BASc</dt>
					<dd class="credential-program">Engineering Physics</dd>
					<dd class="credential-university">Queen's University</dd>
					<dd class="credential-meta">2026</dd>
				</div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-columns {
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
	}

	.credential-card {
		container-type: inline-size;
	}

	.credentials {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.credential-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 4ch minmax(0, 1fr);
		grid-template-areas: 'degree program' '. university' '. metadata';
		gap: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		align-items: baseline;
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
	}

	.credential-row + .credential-row {
		border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
	}

	.credential-row dt {
		grid-area: degree;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.credential-row dd {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.credential-program {
		grid-area: program;
	}

	.credential-university {
		grid-area: university;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.credential-meta {
		grid-area: metadata;
		color: var(--muted);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	@container (min-width: 560px) {
		.credential-row {
			grid-template-columns: 4ch minmax(19ch, 1fr) 20ch 15ch;
			grid-template-areas: 'degree program university metadata';
		}

		.credential-university::before,
		.credential-meta::before {
			content: '· ';
			color: var(--dim);
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 780px) {
		.about-columns {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
